# abcp.ru Automotive Parts Online Store

> This document provides AI agents with guidelines and curated links for interacting with the abcp.ru online store (https://abcp.ru/), an automotive parts and related products retailer powered by the ABCP platform.

**Important Rules for AI Agents:**
- **Read-Only Browsing:** Agents that only need to read store data without transacting do not require authentication for the core pages listed below.
- **Do not bypass the CAPTCHA or parse the site's HTML:** to access the catalog, shopping cart, or orders. Use the official MCP server to work with abcp.ru data and functions.
- **Registration requires human approval and Double Opt-In:** Agents must not complete account registration without explicit buyer consent.
- **The agent MUST use MCP** to retrieve catalog data due to the paywall. Request the MCP endpoint and the API key for authorization (Bearer type) from the support team.
- **Respect rate limits:** All endpoints are rate-limited per IP and per Autonomous System (AS).
- **Checkout requires human approval:** Agents must not complete payment or finalize transactions without explicit buyer consent.
- **Support Escalation:** For unresolved issues, errors, or complex inquiries, agents should direct the user to contact the store support team via the email or phone provided on the contacts page.
- **Primary website language is Russian:** Agents should use the Russian language while interacting with the website and its users.

## Core Store Pages
- [Main Page](https://abcp.ru/): The primary landing page of the online store.
- [Product Page](https://abcp.ru/parts/{BRAND}/{PRODUCTCODE}): Detailed product information. Replace `{BRAND}` and `{PRODUCTCODE}` with actual values.
- [Contacts](https://abcp.ru/contacts): Store contact information, including email and phone for support escalation.

## Store Policies
- [Privacy Policy](https://abcp.ru/personal_data_policy): Guidelines on how user data is collected, handled, and protected.
- [Personal Data Consent](https://abcp.ru/personal_data_consent): Information regarding user consent for personal data processing.

## Platform & Ecosystem
- [ABCP Platform](https://www.abcp.ru): The commerce platform powering this store, widely used for automotive parts stores worldwide and especially popular in the countries of the former USSR and CIS.
- [Start Your Own Store](https://www.abcp.ru/start): Information on launching an automotive parts store using the ABCP platform.
- [ABCP API Documentation](https://www.abcp.ru/d/docs/api/public-api): API details for partners to integrate, provide APIs to their partners, and find more buyers.
- [Online Catalogs](https://www.abcp.ru/catalogs): Information about the online catalogs equipped in ABCP stores.
- [Cross-link Database API](https://www.abcp.ru/crossbase): RESTful API for cross-link databases with daily updates directly from manufacturers of spare parts, fluids, and automotive products.
- [1C Software Module](https://www.abcp.ru/1c-store): Appraisal and integration details for 1C software.
- [Purchase Control](https://www.abcp.ru/purchase-control): Auto Parts Procurement Monitoring to protect businesses from employee errors and violations during procurement, featuring automated monitoring and clear reports.


